<title>USA: U.S. business loans rose $1.2 bln in June 25 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans rose $1.2 bln in June 25 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks rose $1.2 billion to $818.7 billion in the week ended June 25, the Federal Reserve said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
